{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果首款摺疊屏手機iPhone Duo於10月23日正式在全球範圍內開售。按照蘋果多年來的慣例，公司行政總裁會親自現身門店，為新品發售揭開序幕。今年負責這一傳統儀式的人不再是Tim Cook，而是今年9月剛剛接任蘋果CEO的約翰·特納斯。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583600.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T16:24:54.675873+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T16:11:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T16:18:30.670116+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T16:18:30.670116+00:00","content_hash":"41433832ae32221e6e8cceef9ec4b55b9a4997d8cf9fe51fc8247a2c6ff87b92","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}